  "failedAttempts": [
    "the first review-fix attempt found the published map copy only survives when the world is frozen before its chunks load: the lab must be recreated, started, and frozen before force-loading, and the fixture world must not be reused from a forceloaded/dirty lab",
    "the audit mod did not emit input_processed for the fixture's note block: its instrument does not work above the block and the block above is leaves, so vanilla never calls triggerEvent. The mod now records the same processing through the playNote path (with path=playNote) when the block event is not scheduled, and the live run proves it for both copies",
    "the press initially aimed with the wrong Carpet look argument order (look <pitch> <yaw>); the frozen-press window and the second-player retry were also needed before the real machine operation was captured",
    "devcap probes initially loaded stale smoke jars beside the broken probe jar, then locked the running jar; probe deployment now stops the lab and clears stale smoke/probe jars",
    "the post-restart memory verify initially compared falling init-time item entities; it now verifies the machine entities (carts + hover seat) with a corrected snapshot order hash",
    "the memory/order verify and the instance world-resolution check needed an explicit freeze and path normalization before they passed",
    "each failed attempt is retained under labs/fullgate-evidence/ and labs/fullgate-logs/"
  ],
